---
title: How to Delete a Lead?
sidebar:
  order: 4
---
**Remove a lead that is no longer relevant from your list:**

1. **Go to Taskip > Leads.**
1. **Find the lead you want to delete.**
1. **Click the three-dot button on the right of the lead.**
1. **Select Delete Lead.**
1. **Confirm the deletion to remove the lead permanently.**
